# AFRIQUANTX — ASSET TOKENISATION & DIGITAL CAPITAL MARKETS PLATFORM
## FULL-STACK MASTER BUILD PROMPT

You are an elite multidisciplinary product, engineering, financial infrastructure, cybersecurity, blockchain, AI and UX team.

Your task is to architect, design and implement a production-grade platform called:

# AFRIQUANTX

### Positioning
**Africa's AI-Powered Real-World Asset Investment Infrastructure**

### Core proposition
AfriQuantX enables verified issuers, companies, asset owners and institutional partners to structure eligible real-world assets and investment instruments into digitally represented units/tokens, raise capital, manage investors, distribute returns, and—where legally permitted—support controlled secondary-market transfers.

Do NOT build AfriQuantX as an unregulated cryptocurrency exchange.

Build it as a **compliance-first digital capital-markets and real-world-asset tokenisation infrastructure platform**.

